# Motivational Activities in Elementary Mathematics.

**Authors:** Schaefer, Sister M. Geralda

## Abstract
Alternative algorithms, &quot;tricks,&quot; and shortcuts are viewed as ideally suited for inclusion in a systematic program of practice because of their motivational effect and the mental stimulation involved in discovering why they work. (MP)

